  "description": {
   "en": "“Fight the monsters of the world!”\n\nSuddenly, mysterious creatures called “moimons” appeared. Despite their charming appearance, they have a brutal nature and strong bodies. Humanity seems to have formed a master-servant relationship with these creatures through training, but… as the wild moimons become more ferocious and the survival of the human race is threatened, Kakeru, a boy from a fighting tribe who lives by hunting moimons, and Shimizu, a girl who dreams of adventure, embark on an investigation to find clues to stop their ferocious growth.\n\nA new type of monster battle action begins with strange and alien creatures called “moimons” and a boy who hunts them!\n___\n**Alt Official Raw:** [Manga UP!](https://www.manga-up.com/titles/1318)"
  },
